WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:20.448
Cat hissed again.

2
00:00:20.449 --> 00:00:23.820
Tom tapped his pocket to make her stop.

3
00:00:23.821 --> 00:00:28.093
Dirk frowned at Tom.

4
00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:33.498
The queen blew her nose with a honk!

5
00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:40.028
"I want a special dog for Prince Eric," she said.

6
00:00:40.029 --> 00:00:42.538
"See what you can do, Tom."

7
00:00:42.539 --> 00:00:46.800
Tom gulped. "I'll try, Your—"

8
00:00:46.801 --> 00:00:51.303
Dirk stepped forward with an evil smile.

9
00:00:51.304 --> 00:00:55.826
"Tom will start working at once, Your Majesty!

10
00:00:55.827 --> 00:00:58.824
Right, Tom?"

11
00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:13.115
"Right!" Tom said nervously.

12
00:01:13.116 --> 00:01:17.524
Outside the Throne Room, Dirk glared at Tom.

13
00:01:17.525 --> 00:01:24.184
"I know that cat is in your pocket," he said.

14
00:01:24.185 --> 00:01:28.123
Tom froze as Dirk leaned in close.

15
00:01:28.124 --> 00:01:32.603
"Keep that cat away from the queen," Dirk growled.

16
00:01:32.604 --> 00:01:36.143
"And if you fail at this birthday task . . .

17
00:01:36.144 --> 00:01:44.106
You'll be thrown in the Grim Dungeon!"

18
00:01:44.107 --> 00:01:54.050
Tom shivered and rushed off to his lab.

19
00:01:54.051 --> 00:01:58.126
"What am I going to do, Cat?" he asked.

20
00:01:58.127 --> 00:02:01.890
Cat licked her paws.

21
00:02:01.891 --> 00:02:04.955
"You need to find a dog spell.

22
00:02:04.956 --> 00:02:07.302
But I don't like dogs.

23
00:02:07.303 --> 00:02:10.899
They chase cats."

24
00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:16.448
"Maybe I can make a nice dog appear," Tom said.

25
00:02:16.449 --> 00:02:20.609
He lifted his wand. Poof!

26
00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:23.273
"Oops," Tom said.

27
00:02:23.274 --> 00:02:25.608
It wasn't a dog.

28
00:02:25.609 --> 00:02:30.394
It was a hog!

29
00:02:30.395 --> 00:02:46.217
The hog squealed and ran off.

30
00:02:46.218 --> 00:02:51.412
Tom tried another spell. Poof!

31
00:02:51.413 --> 00:02:55.187
"Oops," said Tom.

32
00:02:55.188 --> 00:03:01.784
"Ribbit!" said a big green frog.
